{"version":1,"content":"<p>昨天（28日）是許紹雄（Benz）離世一周年的日子。</p><p>許紹雄的契女劉思葭特別以AI技術製作了一條致敬短片，並由許紹雄的女兒許惠菁代為上載至父親的社交平台，透過影像向大眾分享許紹雄過去一年在「彼岸」的生活情况，藉此慰藉關心他的家人與廣大影迷。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T05:18:16.329778+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":120,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T04:25:29+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T16:58:14.296272+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T05:18:16.329778+00:00","content_hash":"7ff4adc62c6a333a023355032e644704332344f8f04e83168e51e3dce4cc845e","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}